<<< Geant4 Physics List simulation engine: QGSP_BIC

/run/verbose 0
/event/verbose 0
/tracking/verbose 0
/process/verbose 0
#
/run/initialize

 hInelastic QGSP_BIC  Thresholds: 
    0) between BIC and BERT for p, n over the interval 1 to 1.5 GeV. 
    1) between BERT  and FTF/P over the interval 3 to 6 GeV. 
    2) between FTF/P and QGS/P over the interval 12 to 25 GeV. 
  -- quasiElastic: 1 for QGS  and 0 for FTF
### Adding tracking cuts for neutron  TimeCut(ns)= 10000  KinEnergyCut(MeV)= 0
#
# Set a very high time threshold to allow all decays to happen
/process/had/rdm/thresholdForVeryLongDecayTime 1.0e+60 year
#
/process/had/rdm/verbose 0
/gun/energy 0 MeV
/gun/particle ion
#
# First reaction is beta- decay of 24Na ground state.  The range of nuclei does
# not have to be restricted since 24Mg is the only product and is stable.
#
/gun/ion 11 24 11 0
/run/beamOn 1000
